            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_223N2010D">
               <p xml:id="idm115">Hartmann wrote this song for male choir for Studenterforeningen's songbook of 1833. The collection was edited by A.P. Berggreen who asked several prominent composers to contribute as this genre was relatively new. Since Hartmann dated his manuscript as late as 9 December, the collection was probably not published until 1834. It was the first Danish song book with music.</p>
            </history>
